# Golden test fixtures are byte-compared against harness output, and the harness always
# writes LF (tools/banktest/run-banktest.sh and realrom-test.sh both normalize CR away
# before writing). Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites a golden to CRLF on checkout
# and every subsequent `check` reports a WHOLE-FILE diff for a file whose content is
# byte-identical -- the diagnostic trap bead grm-g73 records, where a handful of changed
# lines present as "78 deleted, 101 added" and badly overstate an apparent regression.
*.dump text eol=lf
